# Engine v2 B1 (#2680): a humanoid and a four-legged body walk round a 4 m square at 1 m/s, facing the way they
# walk, and stop. No skill code: this script is the driver.
#
#   body <name> <family> <x mm> <z mm>        a body standing on the open ground (humanoid or quadruped)
#   <ms> <name> claim                         a script driver claims the body's locomotion
#   <ms> <name> walk <vx mm/s> <vz mm/s>      velocity, in the ground's axes
#   <ms> <name> face <yaw mdeg>               facing (0 faces +z, 90000 faces +x)
#   <ms> <name> stop                          velocity zero
#   <ms> <name> release                       the driver ends; the body gets the neutral input
#   <ms> end                                  the run ends
body human humanoid 0 0
body dog quadruped 10000 0

0 human claim
0 human walk 1000 0
0 human face 90000
0 dog claim
0 dog walk 1000 0
0 dog face 90000

4000 human walk 0 1000
4000 human face 0
4000 dog walk 0 1000
4000 dog face 0

8000 human walk -1000 0
8000 human face 270000
8000 dog walk -1000 0
8000 dog face 270000

12000 human walk 0 -1000
12000 human face 180000
12000 dog walk 0 -1000
12000 dog face 180000

16000 human stop
16000 dog stop
17000 human release
17000 dog release
18000 end
